---
title C4 (código) — Ciclo de vida de webhook_events (WebhookProcessor + WebhookEventRepository)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> pending: POST /webhooks/leads\n(INSERT no inbox)
  pending --> processing: claim() — UPDATE condicional\nattempts + 1, locked_until
  processing --> processed: lead criado\n(mesma transação do lead)
  processing --> duplicate: telefone já existe\n(DuplicateLeadError)
  processing --> pending: falha transitória\nscheduleRetry (backoff + jitter)
  processing --> dead: erro permanente (validação)\nou tentativas esgotadas
  processing --> processing: lock expirou (worker morreu)\nreclaim, attempts + 1
  processed --> [*]
  duplicate --> [*]
  dead --> [*]
  note right of processing
    Evento "veneno": attempts passa de
    WEBHOOK_MAX_ATTEMPTS no claim e vai para dead
  end note
